# resizewin on a stack window in tile changes its share of the stack; the others share the rest alike.
# ours: tile gives the last window of a column the rest of it (a mango bug, docs/afvigelser.md §6).
config new_is_master=0
open a
open b
open c
open d
check
ours d.height 351
dispatch @b resizewin,+0,+100
check
